            "exit_code": 0,
            "stdout_sha256": "6c15fc95bd4272348610ddfe53d3a76889c37885324529bbd5a4cbe54b258758",
            "failure_scenario": "Under P1, seed DIR IMAGE <(cat rust-toolchain.toml) passes read_pin; seed then copies the already-drained pipe into the probe as an empty rust-toolchain.toml, and only the later rustc-version assertion stands between that and a mount of the image default.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        }
